<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.200" end="00:00:09.600" style="s2">There was a time when humans took pride</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.700" end="00:00:09.600" style="s2">in their powers.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.000" end="00:00:17.200" style="s2">They believed no one could challenge</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.000" end="00:00:17.200" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.800" end="00:00:43.400" style="s2">Then the darkness came.</p>
<p begin="00:00:41.500" end="00:00:48.000" style="s2">And they learned that strength and</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.400" end="00:00:48.000" style="s2">victory are not the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.000" end="00:01:23.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S DEVOURING [screaming] OUR ENERGY.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.875" end="00:01:23.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.805" end="00:01:27.825" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.045" end="00:01:33.065" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.000" end="00:01:45.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE HUMAN WORLD</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.500" end="00:01:45.900" style="s2">belongs to us now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.292" end="00:02:14.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We just</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.092" end="00:02:39.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still fighting with a stick?</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.592" end="00:02:46.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sword is wood.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.892" end="00:02:46.692" style="s2">My hands are real.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.892" end="00:02:53.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That philosophy is going to get you</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:53.692" style="s2">killed.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.292" end="00:02:57.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will save me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.092" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Novell.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.692" end="00:03:18.492" style="s2">Let&#39;s see what wood does against this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.702" end="00:03:44.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.977" end="00:03:47.997" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.692" end="00:04:07.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Powered by make you faster.</p>
<p begin="00:04:11.694" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t know where to go,</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.694" end="00:04:16.694" style="s2">speed is worth nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.294" end="00:04:22.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep that up and they&#39;ll give you a</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:22.794" style="s2">mission.</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.994" end="00:04:31.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want a mission.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.494" end="00:04:31.194" style="s2">I want to reach</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.653" end="00:04:43.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.823" end="00:04:52.843" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.538" end="00:05:27.558" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.195" end="00:06:25.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king has ordered you brought back.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.595" end="00:06:40.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.095" end="00:06:40.995" style="s2">or to be killed.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.695" end="00:06:47.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The king&#39;s orders are not questioned.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.995" end="00:06:55.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am your king&#39;s daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.495" end="00:06:55.495" style="s2">not your slave.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.269" end="00:07:16.289" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.060" end="00:07:28.080" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.150" end="00:08:19.170" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.997" end="00:09:24.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you human?</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.297" end="00:09:29.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So far,</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.097" end="00:09:29.397" style="s2">yes.</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.097" end="00:09:39.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You truly have no powers?</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.697" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.097" end="00:09:55.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And how did you beat them?</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.597" end="00:09:59.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They didn&#39;t know where I would attack</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.697" end="00:09:59.997" style="s2">from.</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.898" end="00:10:26.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need your help.</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.398" end="00:10:47.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.498" end="00:10:47.298" style="s2">Bandage it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.698" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you with the resistance?</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.998" end="00:11:17.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.798" end="00:11:23.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why save me?</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.698" end="00:11:28.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Demons were trying to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.398" end="00:11:41.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that the only [music] reason?</p>
<p begin="00:11:53.098" end="00:11:56.798" style="s2">Do humans always save each other?</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.988" end="00:12:13.008" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.199" end="00:12:20.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to tell you something.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.999" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">Expression softening, almost</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.299" end="00:12:26.299" style="s2">imperceptibly, it forces the words out.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.599" end="00:12:29.099" style="s2">I&#39;m not human.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:29.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I suspected.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.638" end="00:12:32.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.599" end="00:12:41.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Dravox&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.699" end="00:12:55.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does your father want you dead?</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.899" end="00:13:41.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The humans</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.599" end="00:13:41.299" style="s2">mean nothing to you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.399" end="00:13:48.199" style="s2">Their weakness</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:48.199" style="s2">will make you weak, too.</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.299" end="00:13:52.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They were hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.599" end="00:13:55.299" style="s2">What did they do?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.801" end="00:14:26.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They did nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.901" end="00:14:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Down.</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.001" end="00:15:03.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a brush leaves grows closer</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:03.201" style="s2">than resonant.</p>
<p begin="00:15:07.201" end="00:15:10.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Longest casting</p>
<p begin="00:15:09.101" end="00:15:14.101" style="s2">request not to</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.401" end="00:15:14.101" style="s2">you respect five mouth they raised up.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.320" end="00:15:20.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.501" end="00:15:41.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s a demon.</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.201" end="00:15:48.601" style="s2">I won&#39;t hurt any of your soldiers.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.601" end="00:15:56.401" style="s2">That&#39;s exactly what her father would</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:15:56.401" style="s2">say.</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.901" end="00:16:18.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She saved my life.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.402" end="00:16:26.202" style="s2">I need her help.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.802" end="00:16:48.602" style="s2">Lower it, Riker.</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.502" end="00:17:04.102" style="s2">Your energy matches the energy of</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.502" end="00:17:04.102" style="s2">Trouble and Draxos Palace.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.902" end="00:17:17.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It belonged to my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.502" end="00:17:32.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the moon seal.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.202" end="00:17:42.402" style="s2">Your mother was of an ancient human</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.302" end="00:17:42.402" style="s2">royal bloodline.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.802" end="00:17:55.702" style="s2">You are not only the Demon King&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.602" end="00:17:59.902" style="s2">daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.702" end="00:17:59.902" style="s2">you are heir to both worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.302" end="00:18:18.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You move your left shoulder before every</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.802" end="00:18:18.302" style="s2">attack.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.102" end="00:18:21.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:18:22.102" end="00:18:24.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I?</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.503" end="00:18:29.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your body gives away your next move.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.703" end="00:18:32.303" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll stop giving coiled and</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.903" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">releasing without the slightest shoulder</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.303" end="00:18:34.503" style="s2">turn.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.503" end="00:19:16.603" style="s2">Three this time. Try not to cook.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.703" end="00:19:28.303" style="s2">Her first attempt, weight never rising.</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.203" end="00:19:31.303" style="s2">Her movement a graceful, almost her</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.303" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">strident tree glide on second try</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.303" end="00:19:34.903" style="s2">matches her stride for stride.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.903" end="00:19:49.603" style="s2">Do you ever regret having no powers?</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.303" end="00:19:54.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every day.</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.203" end="00:20:00.903" style="s2">But if I keep thinking about it, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.603" end="00:20:00.903" style="s2">never become what I can be.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.603" end="00:20:19.903" style="s2">My king,</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.203" end="00:20:19.903" style="s2">the princess is with the resistance.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.803" end="00:20:26.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has shown her mother&#39;s weakness</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.905" end="00:20:26.505" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.405" end="00:20:30.705" style="s2">Let me bring her back to you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.305" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.105" end="00:20:42.905" style="s2">She will not stand before me again.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.005" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">Open the black gate.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.605" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">Destroy the resistance camp.</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.205" end="00:20:57.105" style="s2">And my daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.405" end="00:20:57.105" style="s2">kill her.</p>
<p begin="00:20:58.205" end="00:21:03.205" style="s2">I will not let her become weak.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.105" end="00:21:13.105" style="s2">It will be done.</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.879" end="00:21:40.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.740" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.605" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone get back.</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.325" end="00:21:53.345" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.875" end="00:21:59.895" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.505" end="00:22:03.305" style="s2">There are too many.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.735" end="00:22:07.755" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.606" end="00:22:27.906" style="s2">Left.</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.406" end="00:22:48.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father is calling you home.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.406" end="00:22:53.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell him I&#39;m not home.</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.615" end="00:23:10.635" style="s2">[cough]</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.891" end="00:23:13.911" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.806" end="00:23:19.096" style="s2">I can&#39;t move my leg.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.906" end="00:23:21.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grinds lift a hand&#39;s length.</p>
<p begin="00:23:19.096" end="00:23:21.116" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.206" end="00:23:24.406" style="s2">Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:23:21.906" end="00:23:24.406" style="s2">Pull now.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.506" end="00:23:50.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE BLACK GATE MUST BE CLOSED.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.876" end="00:24:13.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.706" end="00:24:13.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WE&#39;LL BRING ELDER BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.406" end="00:24:20.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re taking him to the black gate.</p>
<p begin="00:24:25.106" end="00:24:29.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The black gate is the entrance to the</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.607" end="00:24:29.307" style="s2">demon kingdom.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.707" end="00:24:58.207" style="s2">Dark hold, ancient ruins.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.007" end="00:24:58.207" style="s2">My favorite kind of evening.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.607" end="00:25:26.807" style="s2">Please tell me you can actually read</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.908" end="00:25:28.908" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.807" end="00:25:31.908" style="s2">Old script.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.908" end="00:25:31.908" style="s2">Bring the light closer.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.807" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">A heart belonging to both worlds</p>
<p begin="00:25:39.507" end="00:25:44.107" style="s2">and a hand without magic</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.607" end="00:25:45.908" style="s2">will close what was opened.</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.107" end="00:25:49.007" style="s2">A hand without magic.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.908" end="00:25:49.007" style="s2">Ren, that&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.007" end="00:25:57.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:26:10.707" end="00:26:13.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the same mark.</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.409" end="00:26:50.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humans and demons</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.609" end="00:26:50.509" style="s2">side by side.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.009" end="00:26:58.109" style="s2">The same energy.</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.709" end="00:26:58.109" style="s2">We were never meant to be enemies.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.109" end="00:27:14.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do we close [music] the gate?</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.209" end="00:27:22.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only one without veiled can close it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.509" end="00:27:22.709" style="s2">The gate devours magical energy.</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.409" end="00:27:28.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why him.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.709" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.509" end="00:27:34.009" style="s2">We&#39;ll close it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.409" end="00:27:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have returned.</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.409" end="00:28:03.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came by my own choice.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.109" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.109" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">to help you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.709" end="00:28:19.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here to help her,</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.309" end="00:28:19.409" style="s2">not to ask permission.</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.809" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humans give their weakness the name of</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.109" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">courage.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.710" end="00:29:22.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are like your mother.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.110" end="00:29:22.710" style="s2">Weak.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.910" end="00:29:28.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.310" end="00:29:30.010" style="s2">I am like my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.110" end="00:29:33.210" style="s2">Chin lifted, eyes stead.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.010" end="00:29:33.210" style="s2">And I am proud [music] of it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.910" end="00:30:20.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are nothing before me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.712" end="00:31:28.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long will you keep running?</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.112" end="00:31:34.312" style="s2">Until you get tired.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.913" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rain.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.113" end="00:32:58.513" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.413" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This.</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.913" end="00:33:34.313" style="s2">This is impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.513" end="00:33:46.513" style="s2">Sefra.</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.613" end="00:33:48.613" style="s2">You are my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.513" end="00:33:52.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am your daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.613" end="00:33:55.313" style="s2">But I will not become like you.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.113" end="00:33:55.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The mise.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.213" end="00:34:14.413" style="s2">Defeated by a powerless human.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.214" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.214" end="00:34:59.114" style="s2">are you going to be king now?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.414" end="00:35:04.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.414" end="00:35:10.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what will you do?</p>
<p begin="00:35:14.714" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What I did before.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.814" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">Help people.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:22.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me too.</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.114" end="00:35:26.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps the world doesn&#39;t need a king.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.214" end="00:35:50.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still training?</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.014" end="00:35:57.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A demon challenged me yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.614" end="00:36:07.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still have no powers.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.914" end="00:36:07.214" style="s2">Yet everyone calls you a hero.</p>
<p begin="00:36:10.714" end="00:36:13.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a hero.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.114" end="00:36:16.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what are you?</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.014" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
